{"id":"f990aa46292ead55","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-base-parts.md","title":"Beginning, Ending, and Part Relations in Base p","display":"df-smullyan-base-parts — Beginning, Ending, and Part Relations in Base p","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-base-parts","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-base-parts"],"display":"df-smullyan-base-parts — Beginning, Ending, and Part Relations in Base p","source":"第 III 章 pp. 30–31；第 IV 章 pp. 43–44，Proposition B（PDF 47–48、60–61）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-base-parts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-base-parts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-base-parts — Beginning, Ending, and Part Relations in Base p"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30–31；第 IV 章 pp. 43–44，Proposition B（PDF 47–48、60–61）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73270f29098db683\" href=\"?note=73270f29098db683\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation\">92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为素数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cat}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Cat}_p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Pow}_p\\)</span> 采用上述边界完整的关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p\\)</span> 是下文定义的二元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}base\\text{-}parts}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nx=y\\lor[x&gt;0\\land\\exists z,w,u\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(w)\\land u=x\\cdot w\\land\\operatorname{Cat}_p(u,z,y))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{End}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x=y\\lor\\exists z\\leq y\\;\\operatorname{Cat}_p(z,x,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Part}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Beg}_p(z,y)\\land\\operatorname{End}_p(x,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,2}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}base\\text{-}parts}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nx=y\\lor[x&gt;0\\land\\exists z,w,u\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(w)\\land u=x\\cdot w\\land\\operatorname{Cat}_p(u,z,y))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{End}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x=y\\lor\\exists z\\leq y\\;\\operatorname{Cat}_p(z,x,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Part}_p(x,y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Beg}_p(z,y)\\land\\operatorname{End}_p(x,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p&amp;\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,2}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这三个关系分别比较规范 p 进制位串的非空前缀、后缀和连续片段，含等于整串的情形；0 的位串仍是一位 0。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Beg}_p(0,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Beg}_p(0,y)\\)</span> 只在 y=0 时成立，不能把前导零随意添到其它规范位串前。</p>\n<p>例如十进制中 5 是 5007 的前缀，直接拼接 5 与 7 会丢失两个零，故 Beg 的 w 必须补上这些位；这里十进制例子说明语义，构造算术分类的结论则用于素数底。固定次数的左结合拼接以及它作为片段的关系，也用逐个有界中间值得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 关系。</p>\n<p>原书 p.31 的 Part 显示式把“某个后缀的前缀”写出，但规范数字串去首零使这一写法漏掉内部的数字 0（如十进制 5076）。这里采用该页文字定义“某个前缀的后缀”，即上式的 Beg(z,y) 与 End(x,z)，从而覆盖 0 的片段语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"73270f29098db683","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cat}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}base\\text{-}parts}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p(x,y)&\\leftrightarrow\nx=y\\lor[x>0\\land\\exists z,w,u\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Pow}_p(w)\\land u=x\\cdot w\\land\\operatorname{Cat}_p(u,z,y))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{End}_p(x,y)&\\leftrightarrow x=y\\lor\\exists z\\leq y\\;\\operatorname{Cat}_p(z,x,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Part}_p(x,y)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\leq y\\;\n(\\operatorname{Beg}_p(z,y)\\land\\operatorname{End}_p(x,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Beg}_p,\\operatorname{End}_p,\\operatorname{Part}_p&\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,2}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Beg}_p(0,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"66e51676c0948f71","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]"}],"outgoing":["73270f29098db683"]}